{"default":{"identifier":"default","description":"本地内容（设置窗口）的权限：窗口显隐/最小化/拖拽/DevTools + 全部应用命令（含凭据读写）。**只覆盖本地内容**：远程 SAS 页面（https/http）走的是 remote-sites.json 那套最小权限，所以这里不要列 site-* 窗口（多份 capability 是按并集生效的，写上去等于把 core:default 送给远程页面），也不要给 core:window:allow-close —— 站点窗口的关闭语义是「隐藏到托盘」，把 close() 交给页面后会被 prevent_close 吞掉，表现为按钮点了没反应。","local":true,"windows":["settings"],"permissions":["core:default","core:window:allow-hide","core:window:allow-show","core:window:allow-minimize","core:window:allow-unminimize","core:window:allow-maximize","core:window:allow-toggle-maximize","core:window:allow-set-focus","core:window:allow-set-title","core:window:allow-start-dragging","core:webview:allow-internal-toggle-devtools","allow-get-config","allow-save-config","allow-open-site","allow-new-site-window","allow-close-site-windows","allow-site-window-counts","allow-hide-settings","allow-set-render-mode","allow-set-ui-theme","allow-set-dev-tools","allow-open-url","allow-show-settings","allow-toggle-frameless","allow-get-credential","allow-save-credential","allow-clear-credential"]},"remote-sites":{"identifier":"remote-sites","description":"远程 SAS 站点页面（site-* 窗口）所需的最小 IPC 权限：自绘标题条的隐藏/彻底关闭/最小化/拖动、F11 切换无边框、打开站点设置。不含配置写入与凭据读写——地址由用户在设置窗口填写，不允许页面自行改动。","remote":{"urls":["https://*","http://*"]},"local":false,"windows":["site-*"],"permissions":["core:window:allow-hide","core:window:allow-minimize","core:window:allow-start-dragging","core:webview:allow-internal-toggle-devtools","allow-toggle-frameless","allow-show-settings","allow-close-window"]}}